('Exit light Testing Melbourne', 'exit-light-testing-melbourne', 'Our team of experienced technicians are trained to do the Exit Light testing, Emergency Light Testing, Fire extinguisher testing including in inspection...', '<p>Our team of experienced technicians are trained to do the  Exit Light testing, Emergency Light Testing, Fire extinguisher testing including in inspection, reporting. We can also help in setting up a schedule for check up of exit light at regular intervals. Exit light testing, Visual and Defect Reports, Electrical Cord Testing, Fire Extinguisher, RCD/ Safety Switches, Three Phase Testing, Microwave Testing, Test and tag equipment, are our complementary services.</p>
			<style>/*! elementor - v3.5.3 - 28-12-2021 */
.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=".svg"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width="800" height="800" src="http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Exit-light-Testing-Melbourne-1-1.png" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Exit-light-Testing-Melbourne-1-1.png 800w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Exit-light-Testing-Melbourne-1-1-300x300.png 300w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Exit-light-Testing-Melbourne-1-1-150x150.png 150w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Exit-light-Testing-Melbourne-1-1-768x768.png 768w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Exit-light-Testing-Melbourne-1-1-230x230.png 230w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Exit-light-Testing-Melbourne-1-1-350x350.png 350w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Exit-light-Testing-Melbourne-1-1-480x480.png 480w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Exit-light-Testing-Melbourne-1-1-600x600.png 600w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Exit-light-Testing-Melbourne-1-1-100x100.png 100w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />
															<img width="800" height="800" src="http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Emergency-Light-Testing-Melbourne.png" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Emergency-Light-Testing-Melbourne.png 800w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Emergency-Light-Testing-Melbourne-300x300.png 300w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Emergency-Light-Testing-Melbourne-150x150.png 150w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Emergency-Light-Testing-Melbourne-768x768.png 768w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Emergency-Light-Testing-Melbourne-230x230.png 230w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Emergency-Light-Testing-Melbourne-350x350.png 350w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Emergency-Light-Testing-Melbourne-480x480.png 480w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Emergency-Light-Testing-Melbourne-600x600.png 600w, http://demo.powerq.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Emergency-Light-Testing-Melbourne-100x100.png 100w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />
		<p>Regular testing and maintenance is a measure to keep things under control and  minimise the risk of sudden breakdowns of emergency &amp; exit lights in a workplace. We offer very reasonable prices for Emergency &amp; exit light testing in Melbourne. We recommend a schedule for this as it is a  legislative requirement most of the times, should be done biannually. The goal is to proactively manage the safety for employees and clients in your workplace.</p><p>Why choose PowerQ Test &amp; Tag Melbourne for exit light testing Melbourne</p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;">PowerQ Test &amp; Tag Melbourne team is approachable and friendly and endeavours to deliver qualified testing and tagging services for your electrical needs and assist with complementary services.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;">&nbsp;We promise minimal disruption with any service we offer, to support continuity of your business operations.</li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;">At PowerQ Test &amp; Tag Melbourne, we&nbsp; schedule jobs in advance and can also help with emergency call outs /&nbsp; requests.&nbsp;</li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;">The team adheres to Work Safe standards and regulations, reducing the risk to your company and likewise to our own team.</li>
</ul>', '/blog-img/blog-1.jpg', 'PowerQ Team', 'publish', '2022-07-26 06:26:24', '2022-07-26 06:26:24'),
('Want to know about testing and tagging in Victoria', 'want-to-know-about-testing-and-tagging-in-victoria', 'Testing and tagging is the process of checking the safety of any item that is a portable electrical appliance. It involves two parts, a visual inspection of...', '<p>Testing and tagging is the process of checking the safety of any item that is a portable electrical appliance. It involves two parts, a visual inspection of the device checking for any signs of damage and then testing it with a portable appliance tester. Once tested and it has been confirmed that the device is safe, a tag is placed on it to confirm this, with the next due date for its next test and tag. </p>
